      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Git Branching Basics",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-002",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "right"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "branch",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": true,
            "underline": true,
            "strike": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " lets you work on a feature or a fix without touching the code your teammates depend on. This page is a short, practical guide: ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "what branches are",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", how to name them, and the handful of commands you will use every day. For the full story, see the ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://git-scm.com/book",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pro Git book",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ".",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why branch?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-004",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every project has a stable line of work, usually called ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "main",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Branching keeps experiments away from it:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-005",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Isolation",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — a half-finished feature never breaks the build for everyone else",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-006",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Review",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — a pull request compares your branch with ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "main",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " so teammates see exactly what changed",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-007",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Safety",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — if an idea does not work out, delete the branch and nothing is lost",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-008",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Branches are cheap in Git: creating one copies nothing, it only adds a new pointer. Make them freely, and delete them when you are done.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Naming conventions",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-010",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Short, lowercase and descriptive. Most teams prefix the branch with its purpose:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-011",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Start with a type: ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "feature/",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "fix/",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " or ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "docs/",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-012",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Describe the work, separated by hyphens: ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "feature/login-form",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-015",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Keep it short enough to type, and include an issue number if you have one",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "sc-013",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Good: ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "fix/123-null-avatar",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "sc-014",
          "type": "bulletListItem",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Avoid: ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "my-branch",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " or ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "test2",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Heads up: protect main",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sc-017",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Never commit straight to ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "main",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " on a team project. Open a pull request instead, so that a teammate reviews the change before it lands.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
